---
---

<section class="ho-explainer" aria-labelledby="ho-explainer-title">
  <div class="ho-explainer-copy">
    <p class="ho-eyebrow">What is a harness?</p>
    <h2 id="ho-explainer-title">The operating layer between a model and the real world.</h2>
    <p>
      The model proposes. The harness decides how work is actually run: what state persists,
      which tools are reachable, what requires approval, how work is delegated, what happens
      after failure, and what evidence survives.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="ho-harness-diagram" role="img" aria-label="Operator directs a harness. The harness manages state, permissions, delegation, recovery, and evidence while connecting models to tools and environments.">
    <div class="ho-diagram-node ho-diagram-node--operator">
      <span class="ho-diagram-kicker">Intent</span>
      <strong>Operator</strong>
      <small>goal · constraints · intervention</small>
    </div>

    <div class="ho-diagram-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>

    <div class="ho-diagram-node ho-diagram-node--harness">
      <span class="ho-diagram-kicker">Operating layer</span>
      <strong>Harness</strong>
      <div class="ho-diagram-chips">
        <span>State</span>
        <span>Permissions</span>
        <span>Delegation</span>
        <span>Recovery</span>
        <span>Evidence</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ho-diagram-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>

    <div class="ho-diagram-world">
      <div class="ho-diagram-node">
        <span class="ho-diagram-kicker">Reasoning</span>
        <strong>Model</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="ho-diagram-node">
        <span class="ho-diagram-kicker">Action</span>
        <strong>Tools & APIs</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="ho-diagram-node">
        <span class="ho-diagram-kicker">Execution</span>
        <strong>Environment</strong>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="ho-explainer-punchline">
    Same model. Different harness. <strong>Different operational system.</strong>
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .ho-explainer {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 4.5rem;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    border-radius: 1.2rem;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--sl-color-accent) 12%, transparent), transparent 50%),
      var(--sl-color-bg-nav);
  }

  .ho-explainer-copy {
    max-width: 52rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .ho-eyebrow,
  .ho-diagram-kicker {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .ho-explainer h2 {
    margin: 0.35rem 0 0.65rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 3vw, 2.35rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .ho-explainer-copy > p:last-child {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    font-size: 1.03rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .ho-harness-diagram {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(8rem, 0.8fr) auto minmax(15rem, 1.45fr) auto minmax(12rem, 1fr);
    gap: 0.8rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ho-diagram-node {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    border-radius: 0.8rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-bg);
  }

  .ho-diagram-node strong {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .ho-diagram-node small {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .ho-diagram-node--harness {
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border-color: var(--sl-color-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px color-mix(in srgb, var(--sl-color-accent) 20%, transparent);
  }

  .ho-diagram-node--harness strong {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }

  .ho-diagram-chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
  }

  .ho-diagram-chips span {
    padding: 0.28rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--sl-color-gray-6);
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ho-diagram-arrow {
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ho-diagram-world {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .ho-explainer-punchline {
    margin: 1.35rem 0 0;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }

  @media (max-width: 50rem) {
    .ho-harness-diagram {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ho-diagram-arrow {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
    }

    .ho-diagram-world {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 34rem) {
    .ho-diagram-world {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
